<?xml version="1.0"?>
<h:html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2002/xforms" xmlns:h="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:ev="http://www.w3.org/2001/xml-events" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:jr="http://openrosa.org/javarosa" xmlns:orx="http://openrosa.org/xforms" xmlns:odk="http://www.opendatakit.org/xforms">
  <h:head>
    <h:title>Youth Skin Conditions</h:title>
    <model odk:xforms-version="1.0.0">
      <instance>
        <data id="YAA_Form003_SkinConditions" version="20260902215853" prefix="J1!YAA_Form003_SkinConditions!" delimiter="#">
          <inputs>
            <meta>
              <location>
                <lat/>
                <long/>
                <error/>
                <message/>
              </location>
            </meta>
            <source>user</source>
            <source_id/>
            <user>
              <contact_id/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
              </parent>
            </user>
            <contact>
              <_id/>
              <name/>
              <short_name/>
              <patient_id/>
              <date_of_birth>0</date_of_birth>
              <sex/>
              <parent>
                <_id/>
                <parent>
                  <contact>
                    <nurse_name/>
                    <phone/>
                  </contact>
                </parent>
              </parent>
            </contact>
          </inputs>
          <source/>
          <source_id/>
          <patient_uuid/>
          <patient_id/>
          <patient_name/>
          <patient_short_name/>
          <patient_sex/>
          <patient_date_of_birth/>
          <patient_age_in_years/>
          <patient_age_in_months/>
          <patient_age_in_days/>
          <patient_age_in_weeks/>
          <skin_conditions_group>
            <skin_symptoms/>
            <skin_appearance_pale/>
            <sclera_appearance_abnormal/>
          </skin_conditions_group>
          <calc_impetigo/>
          <calc_ring_worm/>
          <calc_scabies/>
          <calc_anemia/>
          <results_group>
            <res_impetigo/>
            <res_impetigo_action/>
            <res_ring_worm/>
            <res_ring_worm_action/>
            <res_scabies/>
            <res_scabies_action/>
            <res_anemia/>
            <res_anemia_action/>
          </results_group>
          <null_results_group>
            <null_results_note/>
          </null_results_group>
          <meta tag="hidden">
            <instanceID/>
          </meta>
        </data>
      </instance>
      <instance id="contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="user-contact-summary"/>
      <instance id="yes_no">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>yes</name>
            <label>Yes</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>no</name>
            <label>No</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <instance id="skin_symptoms">
        <root>
          <item>
            <name>itching</name>
            <label>Itching</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>blisters_sores</name>
            <label>Blisters, sores, and pustules</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>crusts_lesions</name>
            <label>Crusts or lesions</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>itchy_circular</name>
            <label>Itchy circular lesion with a raised edge and fine scaly area in the center with loss of hair</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>rash_torso</name>
            <label>Rash and excoriations on torso</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>rash_web</name>
            <label>Burrows in web space and wrists</label>
          </item>
          <item>
            <name>face_spared</name>
            <label>Face spared</label>
          </item>
        </root>
      </instance>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs" relevant="./source = 'user'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/source_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/user/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/_id" type="db:person"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/short_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/patient_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/date_of_birth" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/sex" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/_id" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/nurse_name" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact/phone" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/source_id" type="string" calculate="../inputs/source_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_uuid" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_id" type="string" required="true()" calculate="../inputs/contact/_id"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_short_name" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/short_name"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_sex" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/sex"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_date_of_birth" type="string" calculate="../inputs/contact/date_of_birth"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_years" type="string" calculate="floor( difference-in-months(  /data/patient_date_of_birth , today() ) div 12 )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_months" type="string" calculate="difference-in-months(  /data/patient_date_of_birth , today() )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_days" type="string" calculate="floor( decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/patient_date_of_birth ) )"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/patient_age_in_weeks" type="string" calculate="floor((decimal-date-time(today()) - decimal-date-time( /data/patient_date_of_birth )) div 7)"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance_pale" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance_abnormal" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/calc_impetigo" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'crusts_lesions') or selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'blisters_sores'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/calc_ring_worm" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'itchy_circular'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/calc_scabies" type="string" calculate="if(selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'rash_torso') and selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'rash_web') and selected( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms , 'face_spared'), 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/calc_anemia" type="string" calculate="if( /data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance_pale  = 'yes' or  /data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance_abnormal  = 'yes', 'true', 'false')"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group" relevant=" /data/calc_impetigo  = 'true' or  /data/calc_ring_worm  = 'true' or  /data/calc_scabies  = 'true' or  /data/calc_anemia  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_impetigo" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_impetigo  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_impetigo  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_ring_worm  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_ring_worm  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_scabies" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_scabies  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_scabies_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_scabies  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_anemia" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_anemia  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/results_group/res_anemia_action" readonly="true()" type="string" relevant=" /data/calc_anemia  = 'true'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/null_results_group" relevant=" /data/calc_impetigo  = 'false' and  /data/calc_ring_worm  = 'false' and  /data/calc_scabies  = 'false' and  /data/calc_anemia  = 'false'"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/null_results_group/null_results_note" readonly="true()" type="string"/>
      <bind nodeset="/data/meta/instanceID" type="string" readonly="true()" jr:preload="uid"/>
    </model>
  </h:head>
  <h:body class="pages">
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/inputs">
      <label>NO_LABEL</label>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/user">
        <label>User</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/user/contact_id" appearance="select-contact type-person">
          <label>Contact ID</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/user/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        </group>
      </group>
      <group ref="/data/inputs/contact">
        <label>NO_LABEL</label>
        <input ref="/data/inputs/contact/_id" appearance="db-object">
          <label>What is the patient's name?</label>
        </input>
        <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent">
          <label>NO_LABEL</label>
          <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent">
            <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            <group ref="/data/inputs/contact/parent/parent/contact">
              <label>NO_LABEL</label>
            </group>
          </group>
        </group>
      </group>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list" ref="/data/skin_conditions_group">
      <label>Skin conditions</label>
      <select ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_symptoms">
        <label>Skin symptoms to look and ask for.</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('skin_symptoms')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select>
      <select1 ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/skin_appearance_pale">
        <label>Does the skin appear pale or light?</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
      <select1 ref="/data/skin_conditions_group/sclera_appearance_abnormal">
        <label>Does the sclera appear abnormal, or tinted a strange color?</label>
        <itemset nodeset="instance('yes_no')/root/item">
          <value ref="name"/>
          <label ref="label"/>
        </itemset>
      </select1>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list summary" ref="/data/results_group">
      <label>Results</label>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_impetigo" appearance="h1 yellow">
        <label>Impetigo or Folliculitis</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_action">
        <label>The youth may have impetigo or folliculitis. Clean sores with antiseptic. Drain pus if fluctuant. Start cloxacillin tablets if &gt;4cm or red streaks or tender nodes or multiple abscesses for 5 days (Apply antibiotic cream – triple antibiotic ointment).</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm" appearance="h1 yellow">
        <label>Ring Worm (Tinea)</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm_action">
        <label>The youth may have ring worm. If limited to a few patches: Grisefulvine or Ketoconazole cream. If extensive give: griseofulvin tablets, 125 mg with fatty meal (10mg/kg/day), 2 tablets once a day for 6 weeks. If in hair: shave hair, treat as above. If infected (red, warm, pus) add cloxacilline.</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_scabies" appearance="h1 yellow">
        <label>Scabies</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_scabies_action">
        <label>The youth may have scabies. Treat itching: Calamine lotion. Apply: 25% topical Benzyl Benzoate at night, repeat for 3 days after washing. Council hygiene measures: treat all people in the household who are affected, wash bed linen and clothes with warm water and put in the sun, wash affected persons. When infected add cloxaciline.</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_anemia" appearance="h1 yellow">
        <label>Moderate Anemia</label>
      </input>
      <input ref="/data/results_group/res_anemia_action">
        <label>The youth may have moderate anemia. Iron, folic acid – 1 tablet once a day, give for 14 days. Albendazole (400 mg) 1 tablet. Nutrition counseling: green leaves (panzou, lyann panye, moringa, boujon pwa, boujon manyok), fruits, rasped carots and red beet.</label>
      </input>
    </group>
    <group appearance="field-list summary" ref="/data/null_results_group">
      <label>No Results</label>
      <input ref="/data/null_results_group/null_results_note" appearance="h1 green">
        <label>No conditions were met and the patient does not require additional treatment, submit the form.</label>
      </input>
    </group>
  </h:body>
</h:html>